Title: LAST CALL AT BLUE HERON
Author: ActorRoom Studio

INT. COFFEE SHOP - RAINY AFTERNOON

Rain streaks the floor-to-ceiling windows. SARA clutches a cooling mug of tea. LIAM fidgets with a silver keychain.

SARA
(quiet, eyes lowered)
You took the job in Chicago, didn't you?

LIAM
(defensive)
I was going to tell you tonight. It's a partner track, Sara.

SARA
(looking up, hurt)
Tonight? After you signed the lease on Michigan Avenue?

LIAM
(reaching across the table)
Come with me. We can find a loft in Lincoln Park. You can write anywhere.

SARA
(pulling hands back)
You didn't ask me to come with you, Liam. You told me you were leaving.
